+The processor decides ACCEPT, REJECT, or REFER (not enough verified information; a human decides). The final action:
+- REJECT is final only when the validator routes AUTO_APPROVE; a validator HUMAN_REVIEW sends it to a human instead
+- REFER always goes to HUMAN_REVIEW
+- ACCEPT auto-approves only when the validator routes AUTO_APPROVE **and** no hard-rule blocker applies. Blockers are checked in code: amount above `HIGH_VALUE_THRESHOLD` (default $25,000), category not confirmed by the claimant, or claimant email missing / not matching the policy holder email (the policy is re-fetched in Phase 3; a failed fetch blocks)
